Subject: Re: Error in as.GType(type) : Cannot convert RGtkBuilder to GType
Message-ID: <xnKscYivtfA.4a721_FlIKIJ@rattle-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <xnKscYivtfA.lvTNEF1jGygJ@rattle-users.groups.google.com>
References: <xnKscYivtfA.y-8Yk10g0qUJ@rattle-users.groups.google.com> <xnKscYivtfA.lvTNEF1jGygJ@rattle-users.groups.google.com>
